### Third-Party Component Licenses & Notices

RX Media Player utilizes and dynamically links with the following open-source software libraries:

1. **libmpv & FFmpeg**
   - License: GNU Lesser General Public License version 2.1 or later (LGPL v2.1+)
   - Purpose: Multimedia decoding, demuxing, video and audio presentation.
   - Project websites: https://mpv.io / https://ffmpeg.org

2. **SQLite Database Engine**
   - License: Public Domain
   - Purpose: Persistent media library, playback history, resume positions, and bookmarks.
   - Project website: https://sqlite.org

3. **Microsoft Windows SDK (Direct3D 11, DXVA2, WASAPI, Shell, DWM)**
   - Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. All rights reserved.
   - Purpose: Native hardware acceleration, window chrome styling, and audio session management.
